---
source: crates/ostro/tests/cli_p11.rs
expression: "help(&[\"dlq\"])"
---
Dead-letter queue of failed runs (ls, requeue, dismiss)

Usage: ostro dlq <COMMAND>

Commands:
  ls       List DLQ entries (newest failures first)
  requeue  Requeue an entry: resume in place, restart with the same input, or rerun from a cut
  dismiss  Dismiss an entry (it leaves the default view; `dlq ls --all` still shows it)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
